{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive. Build. Share.\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> across multiple user generated maps, or build your own from scratch using the powerful and easy to use\u00a0<strong>World Editor</strong>. Share your creations with the community, explore tracks made by others, and prove your skills on a global scale thanks to asynchronous multiplayer and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.poster.avif?t=1760348736\" width=674 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.webm?t=1760348736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.mp4?t=1760348736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Driving Styles</strong>: Hand-made physics give each car its own personality and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Editor</strong>: Create vast cities or tight circuits, from snowy landscapes to desert plains. Your imagination is the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Share your maps, explore cities made by others, and race across a constantly growing world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing Events</strong>: Compete in high-speed challenges with different car categories and climb the leaderboards against ghosts of friends and rivals.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi Events</strong>: Pick up and drop off passengers in this fun, mission-based driving mode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Bar Mode</strong>: Survive tricky routes with limited health. Challenge your driving precision under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Chase Mode</strong>: Outrun the police and don\u2019t get caught.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Spot Mode</strong>: Drive as the world builds in real-time. Can you react fast enough?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>: Race against friends and rivals. Even if they\u2019re offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Progression</strong>: Climb the ranks, unlock new cars, and expand your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Watch your city come alive with dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Traffic System</strong>: Bring your maps to life with reactive AI traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of Unlockables</strong>: Earn assets and make your creations truly one-of-a-kind. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2010100?t=1760348736","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2010100?t=1760348736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/782e04e2a2035883a2561fa2edc8183bcc17b377/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760348736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/782e04e2a2035883a2561fa2edc8183bcc17b377/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760348736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"no