ts</strong>: Pick up and drop off passengers in this fun, mission-based driving mode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Bar Mode</strong>: Survive tricky routes with limited health. Challenge your driving precision under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Chase Mode</strong>: Outrun the police and don\u2019t get caught.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Spot Mode</strong>: Drive as the world builds in real-time. Can you react fast enough?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>: Race against friends and rivals. Even if they\u2019re offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Progression</strong>: Climb the ranks, unlock new cars, and expand your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Watch your city come alive with dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Traffic System</strong>: Bring your maps to life with reactive AI traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of Unlockables</strong>: Earn assets and make your creations truly one-of-a-kind. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Hues Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/39956764804b3bd12f1e2381237f5f88e3183dd1/header.jpg?t=1760348736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2010100/954463906/9c62011c555fa16d1088bb82c3f87fe4c103c8cc/1753735879/dash_av1.m